OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after lying while
OL,4,Asuing former bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA saleswoman who faked a doctor's note
OL,7,Fabout cancer treatment and invented
OL,8,Fevidence of sexual assaults in London
OL,9,Fwhile suing her former employers has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed.
OL,12,FLouise Gallagher, 50, produced false
OL,13,Fevidence when she sued distribution
OL,14,Fgiant Bunzl for sex discrimination and
OL,15,Fmounted a separate unfair dismissal
OL,16,Fclaim against health product supplier
OL,17,FEssity.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
