OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after lying while
OL,4,Asuing former bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FWood Green Crown Court heard that
OL,7,FGallagher, of of Marlborough,
OL,8,FWiltshire, lied directly to a judge and
OL,9,Fput forward a fictional eyewitness to
OL,10,Fthe police.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Judge Timothy Godfrey
OL,13,Fsentenced her to four years and eight
OL,14,Fmonths in prison after she admitted
OL,15,Fthree counts of perverting the course
OL,16,Fof justice.
